{title: Chain Se Humko Kabhi}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]chain se [A]hamako kabhii aapane [D]jiine na diya
[D]zahar bhii [G]chaahaa agar, [A]piinaa to [D]piine naa diya
[D]chain se hamko kabhii
[D]chaand ke rath [A]men raat kii [G]dulhan jab jab aaegii
[D]yaad hamaarii [A]aapake dil [G]ko tarasaa jaaegii
[D]aapane jo hai [A]diyaa, vo to [D]kisiine naa diyaa
[D]zahar bhii [G]chaahaa agar, [A]piinaa to [D]piine naa diyaa
[D]chain se
